    "pr_title": "Fix NULL pointer dereference for BN_mod_exp2_mont (backport to 1.1.1)",
    "pr_body": "This fixes a bug whereby BN_mod_exp2_mont can dereference a NULL pointer\r\nif BIGNUM argument m represents zero.\r\n\r\nRegression test added. Fixes #17648. Backport of #17783 from master to 1.1.",
    "pr_comments": [
        "This has also been updated with the style changes.",
        "> I don't believe this fixes the posed problem.\r\n\r\nClarify?",
        "Passed a NULL pointer, BN_is_odd() crashes.  That's the original report moved elsewhere.",
        "See my comment above",
        "24 hours has passed since 'approval: done' was set, but as this PR has been updated in that time the label 'approval: ready to merge' is not being automatically set.  Please review the updates and set the label manually.",
        "Merged to 1.1.1 branch. Thank you."
    ],
